Platform Engineering,

The Security Audit team is issuing updated SOX compliance requirements
for all DDL migration audit trails. The updated handbook will be
distributed through the standard update channel.

Key changes:
- DDL migration audit trail retention: minimum 7 years (was 3 years)
- All DDL migrations now require dual approval (SRE manager + DBA lead)
- Postmortem templates must include SOX audit trail fields

Please update your runbooks and Terraform modules accordingly.

— Information Security & Compliance

